  "details": "Based off of Dyno's account filtering feature for discord servers, and a similar suggestion I've wrote for RecRoom's user moderation tools during their uptime.\n\nDespite the fact that there's fear-mongering information going around regarding photonbots, the fact that they are able to join as soon as they are created shows that we do not have enough tools in our disposal to filter out potential alt accounts & evasions.\n\nI think this can be solved by providing tools to group instances that allow them to lock out  potential accounts that are either too newly created and/or in a low trust rank.\n\na lot of this stuff is adjustable to the group's preferences.",
